set default:
    node 0:
    "Hey, can I tell you something really quickly?"
    "I know it's a bit sudden, but I really need to get this off my chest..."
    choice
    * "Sure"
        "Alright, but you have to promise not to judge..."
        choice
        * "I promise"
            "Okay, and also you have to promise not to tell anyone..."
            choice
            * "Yes, I promise"
                "Alright..."
                "Also..."
                choice
                * "Just fucking say it!"
                    "Okay, okay..."
                    goto node:accept
                endchoice
            * "Dude, shut the fuck up"
                goto node:decline
            endchoice
        * "I don't promise"
            goto node:decline
        endchoice
    * "I don't have time for this"
        goto node:decline
    endchoice
    goto node:decline

    node decline:
    "Ugh, I knew it was stupid to ask..."
    "I'm so sorry to have wasted your time like this."
    choice
    * "No problem"
        "Yeah..."
    * "Yeah, you better be"
        "Woah..."
        "No need to get so heated man..."
        "I guess I'll just have to bottle this forever then..."
    endchoice
    "Anyway, I guess I shouldn't waste any more of your time."
    goto END

    node accept:
    "I actually don't have anything to say..."
    "I really wanted to talk to someone and I wasn't really thinking about what I was saying."
    "And all of a sudden you're promising all these things..."
    "I just kind of felt bad for leading you on, so I was waiting for you to shut me up..."
    "This is awkward..."
    choice
    * "You're so dumb"
        "Yeah..."
    endchoice
    goto END